    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Feasibility Study - Bulgaria Feasibility Study: Toplofikacia District Heating Project, through Black &amp; Veatch Holding Company</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">USTDA is funding a feasibility study (FS) to support the Sofia Municipality in the development of a roadmap to overhaul the Municipally owned district heating companys, Toplofikacia, operation, financial condition, and legal and management structure. The company serves more than 420,000 customers and provides central heating and hot water to approximately one million people across Sofia. The roadmap will include proposals for specific, phased implementation of district heating projects to support the modernization of Toplofikacias operations.</narrative>
    </description>
