    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Bulgaria Public Administration Cybersecurity Technical Assistance, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This grant funds technical assistance (TA) to support Information Services JSC, Bulgaria's state-owned information technology services provider, to enhance cybersecurity throughout Bulgaria's public sector. The TA would support the Bulgarian Ministry of Electronic Governance, the ultimate beneficiary of the TA, in implementing and enforcing a National Cybersecurity System across Bulgaria's civilian government agencies. The TA would also support the development of a roadmap for establishing Information Services as a managed security service provider for civilian government agencies.</narrative>
    </description>
