      <narrative xml:lang="en">National Railway Infrastructure Company Fiber Optic Network, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This grant funds a feasibility study for the National Railway Infrastructure Company (NRIC), the state-owned railway company, to deploy fiber across its nationwide railway network and construct a data center and network operations security center (NOSC) to monitor and secure the network. This feasibility study will provide NRIC with a detailed technical plan and business model to deploy a fiber optic network and would allow NRIC to provide reliable, high-speed, and secure telecommunications for the Bulgarian government and critical infrastructure operators, as well as increase domestic telecommunications capacity for consumers and enterprises.</narrative>
    </description>
